Package: lehu
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, adduser, sudo
Recommends: bluez, hostapd
Description: lightweight car head unit for CarPlay and Android Auto
 LEHU turns a Raspberry Pi with a touchscreen into a car head unit: Apple
 CarPlay and Android Auto, wired and wireless, with hardware video decoding,
 its own screens for settings, phones and media, and control by touch or by
 a rotary knob.
